  "description": "One tap builds a castle. The crane swings the piece over a glowing pad and you let go at dead centre — PERFECT lands it true and your combo climbs, a sloppy drop leaves it leaning, and a piece let go under a passing girder is smashed. Cottages, keeps, towers and citadels, drawn fresh every time, across 507 plots that swing faster as you go, with a bonus round against the clock halfway up every one. No ads, no accounts, plays offline.",
